[00:33.32]Staring at death, I take a breath, there's nothing left
{"凝视死亡　我深吸一口气　已一无所有"}
[00:41.19]Now close my eyes, for one last time, and say goodbye
{"此刻闭上双眼　最后一次　道别离"}
[00:48.73]Lying naked while the snow falls all around me
{"赤身躺卧　任雪花将我周身覆盖"}
[00:56.90]Drifting closer to the edge but She won't have me
{"向深渊漂近　她却拒我于门外"}
[01:05.20]Wake up in sweat, full of regret, try to forget
{"冷汗中惊醒　满心悔恨　试图遗忘"}
[01:13.93]These memories, lurking beneath, lost in a dream
{"那些记忆　潜伏在深处　迷失梦境中"}
[01:38.11]Unchosen paths, a broken past, forespoken wrath
{"未择之路　破碎往昔　预言的愤怒"}
[01:45.70]The pain won't cease, I'll find no peace, no sweet release
{"痛苦不止息　寻不到安宁　无甜蜜解脱"}
[01:53.54]Fragile creatures, we are taught to fear the Reaper
{"脆弱生灵　我们被教导畏惧死神"}
[02:01.31]Ever running, we are dead before we meet Her
{"不停奔逃　相遇前便已逝去"}
[02:09.75]These voices telling me let it go (let it all go)
{"那些声音劝我放手（放下所有）"}
[02:17.78]I try and try but I can't say no (try and say no)
{"我反复尝试却无法拒绝（试着说不）"}
[02:25.85]This endless nightmare has just begun (nowhere to run)
{"这无尽梦魇才刚开始（无处可逃）"}
[02:33.84]My heart is dragging me down into oblivion
{"我的心正将我拖向遗忘深渊"}
[02:50.24]The endless lies, I've cast aside, locked them in ice
{"无尽谎言　我已抛弃　冰封冻结"}
[02:58.01]Steeled is my soul, my blood grown cold, I've gained control
{"灵魂如钢　血液冷凝　重掌控制"}
[03:05.59]Fearless creatures, we all learn to fight the Reaper
{"无畏生灵　我们都学会对抗死神"}
[03:13.56]Can't defeat Her, so instead I'll have to be Her
{"无法击败她　便只能成为她"}
[03:22.00]These voices screaming to let it go (never let go)
{"那些声音尖叫着放手（永不放手）"}
[03:30.03]This time I'm screaming back no no no (go on say no)
{"这次我尖叫着拒绝不不不（继续说否）"}
[03:38.10]My mind's made up, yeah my fear is gone (Where have you gone?)
{"心意已决　恐惧消散（你去了何方？）"}
[03:46.48]Open my eyes now here I come, oblivion
{"此刻睁眼　我来了　遗忘之境"}
[04:10.72]For the last time (I won't say goodbye)
{"最后一次（我不会道别）"}
[04:17.65]For the last time (I won't say goodbye)
{"最后一次（我不会道别）"}
[04:25.08]For the last time (I won't say goodbye)
{"最后一次（我不会道别）"}
[04:33.30]For the last time
{"最后一次"}
